1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,260
Gus has to eat a burger

2
00:00:01,270 --> 00:00:02,880
every three minutes, and that's

3
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:04,380
not even his biggest problem.

4
00:00:04,434 --> 00:00:06,124
At seven this morning he woke

5
00:00:06,134 --> 00:00:07,424
up with the metabolism of a

6
00:00:07,434 --> 00:00:08,114
hummingbird.

7
00:00:08,168 --> 00:00:10,128
Gram for gram, that tiny bird

8
00:00:10,138 --> 00:00:12,008
burns fuel fifty times as fast

9
00:00:12,018 --> 00:00:12,668
as he does.

10
00:00:12,722 --> 00:00:14,312
At his size, that's a hundred

11
00:00:14,322 --> 00:00:15,672
