38
00:00:48,084 --> 00:00:49,734
Gus is the baked potato.

39
00:00:49,954 --> 00:00:50,934
He heats up more than a

40
00:00:50,944 --> 00:00:51,964
degree every minute.

41
00:00:52,018 --> 00:00:53,498
Luckily, he lives by the sea,

42
00:00:53,708 --> 00:00:55,058
and water pulls heat out far

43
00:00:55,068 --> 00:00:56,038
faster than air.

44
00:00:56,092 --> 00:00:57,662
Unluckily, it's now been four

45
00:00:57,672 --> 00:00:58,852
